Modernize the UI/UX of the Existing QGuard Messaging Android Application
Objective

The QGuard Messaging Android application is already fully developed and functional.

Do NOT rebuild or replace the application's core functionality.

The goal is to transform the existing user interface into a premium, enterprise-grade Android experience while preserving all existing features, business logic, APIs, cryptographic operations, authentication flows, database interactions, and backend integrations.

This project is a complete UI/UX redesign, not a feature rewrite.

Primary Goal

Redesign every screen to feel like a modern enterprise cybersecurity application comparable to:

Signal
Telegram Premium
Microsoft Teams
Microsoft Authenticator
Proton Mail
Proton Pass
1Password
Bitwarden
Google Material Design 3 applications

