Success Criteria

The final application should look and feel like a flagship enterprise cybersecurity product, not a typical messaging app. Every screen should reflect the quality of commercial platforms such as Signal, Proton, Microsoft Authenticator, Bitwarden, and 1Password, while maintaining QGuard Helix's unique identity as a post-quantum secure messaging platform. The redesign must preserve all existing functionality, improve usability, and deliver a cohesive, polished, and production-ready Android experience.